Model weights (NOT included; downloaded by `hushkey download`)
--------------------------------------------------------------
* LRS3_V_WER19.1 visual speech recognition model and lm_en_subword language model from the
  Auto-AVSR project (Ma et al., ICASSP 2023), via Chaplin's Hugging Face mirror. They were trained
  on LRS3, VoxCeleb2 and AVSpeech; the Auto-AVSR authors note that pretrained models "may have their
  own licenses or terms and conditions derived from the dataset used for training". Treat them as
  research-use only unless you have cleared those terms.
* Adapters you train with Hushkey inherit the terms of the base model and of the data you train on.

Not used
--------
* AV-HuBERT (facebookresearch/av_hubert) is under a non-commercial research license and depends on a
  fairseq fork; Hushkey does not include or require it.
